OL,3,GNEWSAClub's licence suspended ahead of
OL,4,Atougher conditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nightclub has had its licence
OL,7,Fsuspended for six weeks amid
OL,8,Fallegations of the rape of an underage
OL,9,Fgirl who was admitted to the club and
OL,10,Fserved alcohol.
OL,12,FA review by Middlesbrough Council's
OL,13,Flicensing committee heard underage
OL,14,Fdrinking at The Lounge Afrique, on
OL,15,FCorporation Road, was "not an isolated
OL,16,Fincident" with other reports alleging
OL,17,Fsuspected drink-spiking and sexual
OL,18,Fassault.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
