OL,3,GNEWSAClub's licence suspended ahead of
OL,4,Atougher conditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe venue must adhere to stricter
OL,7,Fconditions when it regains its licence,
OL,8,Fincluding new door staff wearing body
OL,9,Fcameras and photo ID electronic
OL,10,Fscanning.
OL,12,FLicence holder Percy Quarcoo previously
OL,13,Faccepted licence conditions had been
OL,14,Fbreached, saying: "I hold my hands up,
OL,15,Fabsolutely. We're deeply sorry about
OL,16,Feverything."
